<Song resolves-to="SongSP" spName="AfternoonInParis-Cm-Theme" spTempo="205">
  <spVERSION>4</spVERSION>
  <spComments>Year:	1949
Composer:	John Lewis
Lyricist:	None — instrumental
Form:	32-bar AABA
Style:	Swing
Key:	C major

John Lewis wrote “Afternoon in Paris” in 1949. The instrumental
is commonly played as a medium swing, with its harmony moving
through several tonal centers, including C, Bb, and Ab.</spComments>
